{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":21447748,"ns":0,"title":"Design-based research","extract":"Design-based research (DBR) is a type of research methodology used by researchers in the learning sciences, which is a sub-field of education. The basic process of DBR involves developing solutions (called \"interventions\") to problems.","description":"Research approach in the learning sciences","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}